# SQ-CDNS-10 and -11 static checks on the full build (feature_writeup/plan_cd_namespace.md 5.2). Fresh world, any type (group A superflat is enough: nothing here depends on terrain or biome).
# Needs tools/scratch_query/zq_probe.js copied as srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zq_probe.js. Oven, seasoning and lunchbox crafting by hand and
# Supplementaries pouring need a player: they are checked in CQ-CDNS-01, not here.
pace 1
## SQ-CDNS-10a | recipe types load under creativedelight
bootreject (?i)(unknown|invalid) recipe.*creativeengineering:(baking|seasoning|lunchbox_)
bootreject creativeengineering:(baking|seasoning|lunchbox_\w+|can_serving|biome_tag)
bootreject replaceItems.*creativeengineering:canned_
> zq bytype creativedelight:baking
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:baking >= 90
> zq bytype creativedelight:seasoning
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:seasoning >= 5
> zq bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_shaped
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_shaped >= 2
> zq bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_upgrade
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_upgrade >= 1
> zq bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_skin
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_skin >= 1
> zq bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_dye
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_dye >= 1
> zq bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_soap
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count bytype creativedelight:lunchbox_soap >= 1
## SQ-CDNS-10b | baking outputs are not air
> zq bytype creativedelight:baking
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
reject bytype creativedelight:baking .* -> .*(minecraft:)?air
## SQ-CDNS-10c | block loot of every moved block with a loot table
> forceload add 0 0
sleep 2
> setblock 0 150 0 creativedelight:oven
> loot spawn 0 151 0 mine 0 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 1 150 0 creativedelight:placed_cauliflower_kuku
> loot spawn 1 151 0 mine 1 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 2 150 0 creativedelight:placed_corn_popsicle
> loot spawn 2 151 0 mine 2 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 3 150 0 creativedelight:placed_dandelion_and_eggs
> loot spawn 3 151 0 mine 3 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 4 150 0 creativedelight:placed_diced_potatoes_with_egg_and_tomato
> loot spawn 4 151 0 mine 4 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 5 150 0 creativedelight:placed_inky_cap_scrambled_eggs
> loot spawn 5 151 0 mine 5 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 6 150 0 creativedelight:placed_omelette
> loot spawn 6 151 0 mine 6 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 7 150 0 creativedelight:placed_shakshouka
> loot spawn 7 151 0 mine 7 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 8 150 0 creativedelight:placed_shulker_omelette
> loot spawn 8 151 0 mine 8 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 9 150 0 creativedelight:placed_suspicious_bacon_and_eggs
> loot spawn 9 151 0 mine 9 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 10 150 0 creativedelight:placed_sweet_potato_pancakes
> loot spawn 10 151 0 mine 10 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 11 150 0 creativedelight:placed_vegetable_omelet
> loot spawn 11 151 0 mine 11 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
> setblock 12 150 0 creativedelight:powdered_sugar_block
> loot spawn 12 151 0 mine 12 150 0 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
sleep 1
count Dropped >= 13
reject (?i)unknown (block|item|loot)|Incorrect argument
## SQ-CDNS-10d | fishing net loot with biome_tag parses and rolls
bootreject (?i)couldn.t parse .*fishing_net
bootreject (?i)biome_tag.*(unknown|invalid)
> loot spawn 0 151 0 loot creativedelight:gameplay/fishing_net/kelp
> loot spawn 0 151 0 loot creativedelight:gameplay/fishing_net/sea_grass
sleep 1
count Dropped >= 2
## SQ-CDNS-10e | tag-driven content resolves under the new tags
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_type/raw/meat
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
> zq itemtag creativedelight:bakeware
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
> zq itemtag creativedelight:cans/servings/3
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
> zq itemtag creativedelight:jar_family/cookies
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
count \[zq\] itemtag >= 4
reject itemtag .*: 0$
> zq itemtag creativecommon:plantable/seed
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
> zq itemtag creativecommon:smokable/log
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
> zq tagsof creativedelight:canned_corn
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
expect creativedelight:cans
## SQ-CDNS-11a | soft fluids, dish block, food values
bootreject (?i)soft.?fluid.*(error|failed|unknown)
> setblock 20 150 0 creativedelight:placed_vegetable_omelet
expect (?i)changed the block
> zq food creativedelight:canned_corn
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
expect (?i)nutrition
